1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:02,790
(Amy:)A colleague of mine did her
graduate thesis on the fungus

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,430
(Amy:)that grows on improperly
sterilized manicure implements.

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,570
(Amy:)Well don't tell me
that's not "girl talk."

4
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:12,520
(Penny:)So where should
we go tonight?

5
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:14,710
(Penny:)A bar? A club? A movie?

6
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:16,370
(Bernadette:)Or we could just stay here.

7
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,940
(Amy:)Yes, and continue to bond.

8
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,680
(Amy:)I have a feeling
that after tonight,

9
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:22,210
(Amy:)one of you will become
my best friend forever.

10
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:25,220
Or "BFF," if you prefer.

11
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,550
(Amy:)Which I don't.

12
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:30,790
(Penny:)All right, time to open
Bachelor Number Two.

13
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:33,160
(Bernadette:)Gee, I don't know
if I should drink more.

14
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:35,330
(Bernadette:)I have to drive home,
and I've got enough trouble

15
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:38,160
(Bernadette:)seeing over the dashboard
as it is.

16
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:41,470
(Penny:)That's okay.
You can just sleep here.

17
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:43,770
(Amy:)Oh, good, a slumber party!

18
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:46,140
(Amy:)We'll do makeovers,
initiate phony phone calls,

19
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:49,170
(Amy:)and have spirited pillow fights
in our frilly nighties!

20
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:50,710
(Penny:)Oh, gosh, Amy.

21
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:53,180
(Penny:)I don't know if I would call
this an actual slumber party.

22
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:54,480
(Amy:)Well, that's disappointing.

23
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:56,280
(Amy:)I've always wanted to be
invited to a slumber party.

24
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,750
(Bernadette:)Oh, you never were?

25
00:00:57,750 --> 00:00:59,220
(Penny:)Not even when
you were a kid?

